 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Growth for «لئن شكرتم لأزيدنكم» (nothing on the threat), geometric for «فإن الله لغني حميد» (after Musa's name). As-Sa'di's first-person «من نعمي» and «فلن تضروا الله شيئا» (an echo of 3:144) are not used. STAGING v4: The same plain town by day as 14_4-6: Musa a blue drop labelled «موسى» on the left, his people three faceless men on the right (Al-Muyassar: Musa said to them). Musa speaks (7:1 and 8:1, the arcs toward his people); wide holds only (no close-up or pan on his drop); nobody else gestures inside his speech. c1 (7): a growth plate for if you are grateful I will increase you (7:5-6); nothing is acted in the conditional and the threat (7:7-11). c2 (8): nothing is acted in the conditional if you disbelieve, you and all on earth (8:3-9); geometric for Allah is Free of need, Praiseworthy (8:10-13). The cover shows Musa and his people under the growth plate (7:5)."
 },
